{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33037","headline":"怨歌行 · 曹邺","name":"怨歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丈夫好弓剑，行坐说金吾。\n喜闻有行役，结束不待车。\n官田赠倡妇，留妾待舅姑。\n舅姑皆已死，庭花半是芜。\n中妹寻适人，生女亦嫁夫。\n何曾寄消息，他处却有书。\n严风厉中野，女子心易孤。\n贫贱又相负，封侯意何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}